### ===== NOTIFICATION TESTS =====

# These endpoints would be implemented in the notifications module
### Get User Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Mark Notification as Read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/notifications/notification-id-here/read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ===== GROUP TESTS =====

# These endpoints would be implemented in the groups module
### Create Group
POST {{baseUrl}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "گروه خانواده",
  "description": "گروه خانوادگی ما",
  "type": "family",
  "privacy": "private"
}

### Get User Groups
GET {{baseUrl}}/groups
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

